  <item nodeId="node-0">
    <command xml:space="preserve">Projekt_DP</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You must choose a character first. Type 1 or 2.&#x000A;&#x000A;Welcome to the game! It was created as a project for the Declarative Programming course. However, I hope you will still enjoy playing it.&#x000A;&#x000A; Choose your character:&#x000A;1 - Ivan (has a torch and one gold coin)&#x000A;2 - Petar (has nothing)&#x000A;&#x000A;Type 1 or 2 to continue.&#x000A;&#x000A;Projekt iz kolegija Deklarativno programiranje&#x000A;An Interactive Fiction by Lucija Polak&#x000A;Release 1 / Serial number 260107 / Inform 7 v10.1.2 / D&#x000A;&#x000A;You must choose a character first. Type 1 or 2.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
